# world -- and the two generators its makefile runs before it.
#
# This used to be one recipe called `convert', which was wrong twice: it built
# world's game sources under the wrong module name, and `convert' in the
# makefile is not a program at all but a `touch'ed timestamp.  It failed on
# `can't open parame.inc', which is GENERATED -- vcnvrt reads vocab.dat and
# vtxtcn reads vtext.dat, and neither data file was in SRC/world.  Both were
