# Added 2026-08-22, the long-source-list trees.  These need rebuild.sh's
# split path (each source compiled on its own line, the objects gathered with
# `merge -z'), because SCF will not read a line longer than 512 bytes -- an
# OS limit, not a bug -- and a longer command line arrives cut off.
